bluejetty:00156448:ios.description:
kkVPN is an easy-to-use VPN app. Highlights: 
Secure & fast; 
easy to use;
free VPN service with some Ads;
no-ad premium service with more servers;
app embedded L2TP accounts to equip all your smart devices;
kkVPN protects your mobile communication with bank grade security. Once launched, it auto connects and your mobile communication is secure and hackers are kept out. 
Built-in kkVPN L2TP accounts allow you to equip all your smart devices with VPN: phones/tablets/computers/set top boxes and even some routers. 
Data security sensitive folks know the best. We recommend you use kkVPN in these scenarios: 
1. Use kkVPN when you are connected to open Wi-Fi in places such as airports, libraries, and hotels, etc. to keep possible hackers out so they can't see sites or services you are visiting. 
2. Use kkVPN at home in case you think your ISP is collecting your browsing data and trying to send you targeted ads., or even worse they sell such info to other companies. With kkVPN, your ISP won't be able to track what you buy, what you watch online, or which political party you are affiliated with. Your data with VPN on is encrypted and they won't be able to decrypt it.

